      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Completed the fifth core milestone of the StatCraft roadmap — full modernization of the **Output Viewer** to achieve 100% functional parity with IBM SPSS Statistics Viewer:"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424051000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Hierarchical Document Data Model:**\n   - Implemented a structured typed document model on L6 `statcraft_app`: `OutputProcedure`, `OutputNotes` (dataset & sample metadata), `OutputItem`, and `OutputItemKind` (`DescriptivesTable`, `FrequencyTable`, `DatasetSummary`, `Warning`, `CustomText`), managed via `SelectedTarget`.\n   - Results now accumulate in an infinite, continuous vertical document scroll — new analyses append below without clearing or replacing previous results."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424052400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Outline Tree Pane & Vector-First UI:**\n   - The left outline pane includes a quick action toolbar: \"Clear All\" (`output-btn-clear-all`), \"Expand All\" (`output-btn-expand-all`), and \"Collapse All\" (`output-btn-collapse-all`).\n   - Collapsible hierarchical tree: document root (`paint_output_root_icon`), procedure folders (`paint_output_folder_icon` + `paint_vector_arrow`), syntax log (`paint_output_log_icon`), analysis notes (`paint_output_notes_icon`), pivot tables (`paint_output_table_icon`), and warnings (`paint_output_warning_icon`).\n   - All icons are 100% vector-rendered using `ui.painter()`, preventing \"tofu\" glyph rendering artifacts."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424054100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Synchronized Navigation & Focus Indicator:**\n   - Clicking any item in the outline tree smoothly scrolls the canvas directly to that element (`ui.scroll_to_rect`) and highlights it with an accent focus outline (`Tokens::ACCENT`).\n   - Clicking an item directly on the canvas synchronizes the selection back to the outline tree.\n   - Fast item deletion via `Delete` key and context menus."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424055300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "4. **TSV Export (Excel / Google Sheets Compatibility):**\n   - Implemented tab-separated values (TSV) serialization for descriptives, frequencies, notes, and dataset summaries.\n   - Table context menus allow one-click copying directly to the system clipboard for immediate pasting into spreadsheets with column integrity preserved."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424056200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "5. **Syntax Logging & Analysis Metadata:**\n   - The \"Paste\" button in `Descriptives` and `Frequencies` dialogs appends genuine SPSS syntax to the syntax log.\n   - Analyses automatically record an authentic SPSS-style `Notes` block detailing dataset name, case count, variable count, and UTC timestamp."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424057200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "6. **Verification & Definition of Done:**\n   - Strict Resource Guard: compilation and checks run strictly with `-j 1`.\n   - 100% workspace tests passing (`cargo test --workspace -j 1`).\n   - `cargo clippy --workspace -j 1 -- -D warnings` and `cargo fmt --check` clean.\n   - Architectural layering verified with `cargo run --package xtask -j 1 -- layers`.\n   - Localization linter `i18n_lint_test` verifies zero hardcoded Cyrillic strings and complete key parity."
