    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Phase 5.1: Elimination of Layout Overflows in i18n (Layout Shield)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1795702921424060600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "*Time: October 27, 2026, 23:20 (~25 minutes)*"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424061700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Resolved layout overflow and column collision issues when switching to languages with longer word lengths (Russian, German, etc.):\n1. **Dynamic Column Width Measurement in Pivot Tables (`output_view.rs`):**\n   - Replaced static column widths with dynamic measurement via `painter.layout_no_wrap` considering font and cell padding (`max(base_min_w, measured_text_w + padding)`). This handles compound multi-tier headers (\"Valid Percent\", \"Cumulative Percent\") without truncation.\n   - Tables wrapped in `ScrollArea::horizontal()`, enabling smooth scrolling across multi-column tables.\n   - Each cell strictly clips its rendering area (`with_clip_rect`), preventing text spillover across column borders.\n2. **Compact Vector Outline Toolbar:**\n   - Replaced overflowing text buttons (\"Clear All\", \"Expand All\", \"Collapse All\") with compact vector icon buttons ($24 \\times 22$ px) equipped with hover tooltips:\n     - `paint_icon_trash` — trash can for clearing all entries;\n     - `paint_icon_expand_all` — expand outline tree;\n     - `paint_icon_collapse_all` — collapse outline tree.\n   - Enforced hard clipping (`ui.set_clip_rect`) on both outline and canvas panels, eliminating cross-separator spillover.\n3. **Auto-Adjusting Header Widths in Variable View (`variable_view.rs`):**\n   - Table headers (`Decimals`, `Missing`, `Values`, etc.) automatically adapt to localized text length without truncation.\n4. **Verification & Release:**\n   - 65 workspace tests passing (`cargo test --workspace -j 1`).\n   - `cargo clippy --workspace -j 1 -- -D warnings` — 0 errors, 0 warnings.\n   - `cargo test -p statcraft_i18n --test i18n_lint_test -j 1` — 0 raw Cyrillic strings in app source.\n   - Built production release binary `target\\release\\statcraft_app.exe` (6,470,144 bytes)."
      },
