      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Phase 5.4: Monolithic Custom Titlebar in PhotoCraft / Photoshop Style"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1795702921424081400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "*Time: October 28, 2026, 01:30 (~25 minutes)*"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424082500",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Transformed the application's top bar into a unified, modern Client-Side Decoration (CSD) titlebar modeled on the PhotoCraft architectural standard:\n1. **Borderless Window Mode (`main.rs`):**\n   - Configured `ViewportBuilder::default().with_decorations(false).with_resizable(true)` to eliminate the heavy native OS frame.\n2. **Unified Monolithic 34 px Bar (`titlebar.rs` & `app.rs`):**\n   - **Left:** Crisp, enlarged StatCraft icon ($24 \\times 24$ px) **with no redundant application name text alongside**, immediately preceding all 12 canonical menus;\n   - **Center:** Adaptive centering of the active document name (`Untitled-1 •` or the imported dataset name) using `title_x` with collision avoidance and graceful truncation/hiding on narrow viewports;\n   - **Right:** Native-sized Windows caption button group (width $46 \\times 3 = 138$ px):\n     - 100% vector-rendered glyphs (`line_segment`, `rect_stroke`) for Minimize, Maximize/Restore, and Close;\n     - Distinctive accent red hover background (`CAPTION_CLOSE_HOVER`) on Close, subtle theme hover on other controls;\n     - Localized hover tooltips (`caption-minimize`, `caption-maximize`, `caption-restore`, `caption-close`).\n3. **Frameless Window Interactivity:**\n   - Entire free gap between menus and caption buttons supports dragging (`ViewportCommand::StartDrag`) and double-click maximize/restore toggle;\n   - Invisible perimeter resize zones (`render_resize_zones`) with 4 px edges and 8 px corners with responsive mouse cursor icons, auto-suppressed when maximized.\n4. **Verification & DoD:**\n   - 100% passing across all 65 workspace tests (`cargo test --workspace -j 1`).\n   - `cargo clippy --workspace -j 1 -- -D warnings` — 0 warnings.\n   - Built optimized production binary `target/release/statcraft_app.exe`."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424085000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424086100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Phase 5.5: Responsive Menu Overflow, Vertical Centering & Window Drag Restoration"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1795702921424086700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "*Time: October 28, 2026, 01:55 (~25 minutes)*"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424087600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Addressed user feedback on top bar layout alignment and frameless window interactions:\n1. **Geometric Vertical Centering:**\n   - Switched from `ui.horizontal` (with implicit top `Align::Min`) to `ui.with_layout(Layout::left_to_right(Align::Center))`.\n   - The $24 \\times 24$ px icon and 13 pt menu buttons are now vertically centered within the 34 px bar with balanced 5 px and 7 px margins.\n2. **Restored Dragging and Double-Click Maximize/Restore:**\n   - Identified root cause: `egui::menu::bar` internally called `ui.set_min_width(ui.available_width())`, consuming all remaining horizontal width and collapsing `drag_rect` width to `0.0`.\n   - Replaced expanding `menu::bar` with direct centered `ui.menu_button` calls, giving an accurate `menus_end_x` measurement.\n   - The large `drag_rect` gap between menus and window caption buttons now reliably dispatches `ViewportCommand::StartDrag` on drag and `ViewportCommand::Maximized` on double click.\n3. **Responsive Menu Overflow (`»`):**\n   - Calculated font-rendered widths for each menu item via `ui.fonts().layout_no_wrap`.\n   - If a menu item cannot fit before the right caption button group (`controls_start_x`), it and all subsequent menus gracefully collapse into a compact overflow menu button (`»` / `t!(\"menu-overflow\")`) displaying them as cascading submenus.\n   - Menus never overlap the window caption buttons regardless of window width.\n4. **Quality & Verification (DoD):**\n   - 100% workspace tests passing (`cargo test --workspace -j 1`).\n   - Localized via Fluent with zero raw Cyrillic strings in app code (`i18n_lint_test`).\n   - Clean `clippy --workspace -j 1 -- -D warnings` (0 errors, 0 warnings).\n   - Produced optimized release binary `target/release/statcraft_app.exe`."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424090300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
