      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented the fundamental dimension reduction procedure of IBM SPSS Statistics — **Factor Analysis / Principal Component Analysis** (`Analyze -> Dimension Reduction -> Factor...`), complementing Reliability Analysis (Cronbach's Alpha) for comprehensive psychometric and multivariate validation:"
