      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented the fundamental psychometric, survey, and applied statistical measurement procedure — **Reliability Analysis** (`Analyze -> Scale -> Reliability Analysis...`, engine command `stat.scale.reliability` / syntax `RELIABILITY /VARIABLES=... /SCALE('ALL VARIABLES') ALL /MODEL=ALPHA`):"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424359800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Mathematical Engine L2 (`statcraft_algo::reliability` & `reliability_types`):**\n   - Internal consistency estimation via Cronbach's Alpha: $\\alpha = \\frac{k}{k - 1} \\left( 1 - \\frac{\\sum s_i^2}{s_{total}^2} \\right)$;\n   - Standardized Alpha based on average inter-item correlation $\\bar{r}$: $\\alpha_{std} = \\frac{k \\bar{r}}{1 + (k - 1) \\bar{r}}$;\n   - Listwise missing data deletion across all analyzed scale items;\n   - Case Processing Summary: Valid ($N, \\%$), Excluded ($N, \\%$), and Total ($N, 100.0\\%$);\n   - Item Statistics: Mean ($\\bar{x}_i$), Standard Deviation ($s_i$), Valid Sample Count ($N$);\n   - Item-Total Statistics:\n     * Scale Mean if Item Deleted: $\\mu_{-i} = \\mu_{total} - \\bar{x}_i$;\n     * Scale Variance if Item Deleted: $s_{-i}^2 = s_{total}^2 + s_i^2 - 2 \\text{Cov}(X_i, X_{total})$;\n     * Corrected Item-Total Correlation: $r_{i(total - i)} = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(X_i, X_{total}) - s_i^2}{\\sqrt{s_i^2 \\cdot s_{-i}^2}}$;\n     * Cronbach's Alpha if Item Deleted: $\\alpha_{-i} = \\frac{k - 1}{k - 2} \\left( 1 - \\frac{\\sum_{j \\neq i} s_j^2}{s_{-i}^2} \\right)$ for $k > 2$;\n   - Summary Scale Statistics: Mean, Variance, Standard Deviation, Item Count;\n   - Seamless synergy with active sample filtering (`Select Cases`) and frequency weighting (`Weight Cases`);\n   - **Golden Oracle:** Unit and validation tests in `reliability_tests.rs` with analytical precision $\\le 10^{-6}$;\n   - **Never Crash** protection: safe handling of $k < 2$, zero-variance degenerate scales, identical survey responses, and missing values on 100% safe Rust."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424361900",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Command Bus & Syntax L5 (`statcraft_syntax::commands::reliability_cmd`):**\n   - Strongly-typed `ReliabilityCommand` (`stat.scale.reliability`) with parameter `specs()` for external AI agents;\n   - Canonical IBM SPSS Statistics syntax generator:"
