      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented the classical exploratory procedure for subgroup analysis of IBM SPSS Statistics — **Subgroup Means Breakdown** (`Analyze -> Compare Means -> Means...`), combining detailed cell-level summary statistics across factor levels, one-way analysis of variance (ANOVA), and measures of association:"
