    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented the canonical machine learning and predictive data preparation procedure from IBM SPSS Statistics — **Prepare Data for Modeling** (*Automated Data Preparation, ADP*, menu item `Transform -> Prepare Data for Modeling (ADP)...`, engine command `transform.adp`, and syntax `ADP`):"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424571900",
