      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Mathematical Core and L2 Algorithms (`statcraft_algo::adp`):**\n   - Created an isolated submodule `crates/statcraft_algo/src/adp/` complying with File Size Guard ($\\le 300$ lines per leaf file);\n   - **Data Quality Screening (`screening.rs`):** multi-criteria input screening filtering out high-missing variables (default $>50\\%$), quasi-constant fields (predominant mode $>95\\%$), and identifier-like high-cardinality keys ($>95\\%$ unique values with $N \\ge 20$) with case weighting support;\n   - **Outlier Detection & Treatment (`outliers.rs`):** weighted Z-score ($3.0\\sigma$) and Interquartile Range ($1.5 \\times IQR$) cutoffs with Winsorizing (capping to bounds) or system-missing replacement;\n   - **Rescaling & Categories (`transform.rs`):** continuous Z-Score standardization ($(x - \\mu)/\\sigma$) and Min-Max scaling to $[0, 1]$, sparse category merging ($<5\\%$) into `'Other'` with automated `ValueLabels` dictionary generation, supervised MDLP binning when target is specified;\n   - **Feature Construction (`transform.rs`):** automatic construction of pairwise interaction terms (cross-products `P_var1_X_var2 = var1 * var2`) for top predictive features;\n   - **Predictive Power Evaluation (`predictive_power.rs`):** predictor association ranking against target via Pearson correlation $r$ and One-Way ANOVA $\\eta^2$ with exact $p$-value computation;\n   - **Sample Partitioning (`partition.rs`):** deterministic stratified/random dataset partitioning into Training (70%), Testing (20%), and Validation (10%) subsets with a dedicated `_Partition_` column, value labels, and PRNG seed control;\n   - Mathematical Golden Oracle validation (`tests.rs`)."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424573700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Command Bus and Syntax L5 (`statcraft_syntax::commands::adp_cmd`):**\n   - `PrepareDataModelingCommand` (`transform.adp`) with JSON Schema `specs()` for AI agents;\n   - Canonical SPSS syntax generator: `ADP /FIELDS TARGET=... INPUTS=... /OBJECTIVE ... /PREPAREINPUTS ... /OUTLIERS ... /RESCALE ... /CATEGORICAL ... /TRANSFORM ... /CONSTRUCT ... /PARTITION ... \\n EXECUTE.`;\n   - Registration in `CommandBus::with_defaults()`, inserting transformed `P_*` and `_Partition_` columns into `DataSet`, 100% Undo/Redo support (`Ctrl+Z`), and integration test suite `crates/statcraft_syntax/tests/adp_cmd_tests.rs`."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424575700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Output Viewer Pivot Tables L4/L6 (`tables_adp.rs`):**\n   - Four authentic SPSS pivot tables: *Automated Data Preparation Summary*, *Action Log / Field Processing Details*, *Predictive Power / Feature Importance*, and *Partition Breakdown*;\n   - Clipboard TSV copying and report export via `adp_to_tsv`."
