    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Completed the final remaining item in the **«Transform»** menu, achieving 100% feature activation across all procedures in this category — **«Programmability Transformations...»** (menu item `Transform -> Programmability Transformations...`, engine command `transform.programmability`, and syntax `BEGIN PROGRAM ... END PROGRAM.`):"
