    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Completed the comprehensive, line-by-line Clean-Room audit of all remaining StatCraft core modules and subsystems according to the Phase 2 Microplans Register (M-09 through M-20, Blocks 11–14). The entire evidentiary ledger is recorded in **Craft Anything MCP** (`hyp_16` through `hyp_32: supported`):"
