    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Block 11: Programmability & Random Number Generation (M-09, M-10):**\n   * **M-09 (`programmability.rs`, `programmability_cmd.rs`):** line-by-line verification of expression assignments `VAR = EXPR` and conditional statements `IF COND THEN ... ELSE ...`. Verified statement atomicity, structured `ProgrammabilityResult` output, safe division-by-zero/missing mapping to `RawValue::Null` (`Never Crash`), and 100% Undo/Redo restoration via snapshots of overwritten and newly created columns;\n   * **M-10 (`rng.rs`, `random_seed_cmd.rs`):** confirmed thread-safe atomic `GLOBAL_SEED` lifecycle, SPSS boundary validation $[1, 2\\,000\\,000\\,000]$, `SET SEED = n`, and `SET SEED = RANDOM`. Noted modern 64-bit SplitMix64 PRNG ($2^{64}$ period, passes BigCrush) in `adp/partition.rs` replacing SPSS's 1970s LCG."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424619700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Block 12: Data Management, Filtering, Subsets & Metadata (M-11 — M-15):**\n   * **M-11 (`select_cases_cmd.rs`, `dataset.rs`):** verified non-destructive `FILTER BY` via `active_row_indices(ds)` and destructive `SELECT IF` with 100% Undo table restoration. Synthesized `filter_$` variable with labels `Selected` / `Not Selected` fully confirmed;\n   * **M-12 (`sort_cases.rs`, `sort_cases_cmd.rs`):** verified stable multi-key sorting. Missing value positioning invariant confirmed: `compare_raw_values` assigns `Ordering::Less` to missing values (smallest / $-\\infty$), placing them at the beginning in ascending sort (A) and at the end in descending sort (D), exactly matching IBM SPSS canon;\n   * **M-13 (`weight_cases_cmd.rs`, `dataset.rs`):** verified `ds.weight_var` binding. In `row_weight(r)`, cases with $w_i \\le 0$, $w_i = \\text{NaN}$, and filtered rows receive zero weight and are excluded from statistics;\n   * **M-14 (`split_groups.rs`, `split_file_cmd.rs`):** confirmed combinatorial partitioning into `SplitSubgroup`, filter awareness, missing value isolation into `.` groups, and automated prepending of `SORT CASES BY ... (A)`;\n   * **M-15 (`variable.rs`, `var_metadata_cmds.rs`):** confirmed model for all 11 canonical SPSS dictionary attributes, discrete and range `MissingValues`, and deterministic `ValueLabels`."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424621300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Block 13: Input/Output Codecs (M-16 — M-19):**\n   * **M-16 (`spss_loader/`):** confirmed decoding of Record Types 1 ($FL2/$FL3), 2 (variables), 3/4 (ValueLabels), 7 (subtypes 3, 4, 11, 13, 20 UTF-8), bytecode compression, and zsav ZLIB block decompression without panics;\n   * **M-17 (`excel_loader.rs`):** automatic type inference and SPSS header sanitization (prefix `V_`, `_`, `VAR00001` fallback);\n   * **M-18 (`csv_loader.rs`, `csv_writer.rs`):** strict RFC 4180 compliance and lossless round-trip;\n   * **M-19 (`stc_codec.rs`):** 100% preservation of `VariableDictionary` attributes alongside Apache Parquet chunks."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921424622900",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "4. **Block 14: Pivot Tables & Reporting (M-20):**\n   * **M-20 (`statcraft_reporting`):** `PivotTable` model with two-tier super-headers, leading zero suppression `.000` for probability metrics, and TSV/HTML/TXT export fidelity matching SPSS styles."
