    {
      "data": {
        "text": "5. **Quality Control & Definition of Done:**\n   * Synchronized bilingual documentation in `docs/SPSS_ALGORITHMS_AUDIT.md` and `docs/SPSS_ALGORITHMS_AUDIT_RU.md`;\n   * Updated investigation report in `docs/CRAFT_ANYTHING_AUDIT_REPORT.md` (all open questions resolved);\n   * 100% pass across full pipeline: `cargo test --workspace -j 1`, `cargo clippy --workspace -j 1 -- -D warnings`, `xtask file-guard` (267 files), `xtask layers` (L0–L6), `xtask design-guard`, `xtask parity`."
