    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Prepared and released **StatCraft v0.2.2** with version bumps across all project packaging manifests, authored an exhaustive bilingual feature guide (`docs/FEATURES.md` and `docs/FEATURES_RU.md`), and integrated direct links into root documentation files `README.md` and `README.ru.md`:"
