zed incomplete beta function;<br>   - Configurable confidence intervals for coefficients $B$ with customizable confidence level (default: 95%);<br>   - Complete Analysis of Variance (ANOVA) table: sums of squares $SS_{reg}, SS_{resid}, SS_{total}$, degrees of freedom $df_{reg} = p, df_{resid} = N - p - 1, df_{total} = N - 1$, mean squares $MS$, $F$-test statistic, and asymptotic $p$-value;<br>   - Model Summary: $R = \sqrt{R^2}$, $R^2 = SS_{reg} / SS_{total}$, Adjusted $R^2_{adj} = 1 - \frac{MS_{resid}}{MS_{total}}$, standard error of the estimate $s_e = \sqrt{MS_{resid}}$;<br>   - Collinearity diagnostics: Tolerance ($Tolerance_j = 1 / r^{jj}$) and Variance Inflation Factor ($VIF_j = 1 / Tolerance_j$) computed from the inverted predictor correlation matrix $R_{xx}^{-1}$;<br>   - **Golden Oracle:** Test suite `regression_tests.rs` verifying regression coefficients, $t$-statistics, $R^2$, ANOVA $F$, Tolerance, and VIF against Python `scipy.stats` and `numpy.linalg.lstsq` benchmarks with $\le 10^{-6}$ precision;<br>   - **Never Crash** protection: graceful handling of singular matrices, multicollinearity, small samples ($N \le p + 1$), zero predictor variance, and missing values in 100% safe Rust with zero panics.</p><p>2. **Command Bus &amp; Syntax L5 (`statcraft_syntax::commands::regression_linear_cmd`):**<br>   - Strongly-typed `LinearRegressionCommand` (`stat.regression.linear`) with parameter `specs()` for external AI agents;<br>   - Listwise missing value deletion across all specified dependent and independent variables;<br>   - Seamless synergy with active sample filtering (`Select Cases`) and frequency weighting (`Weight Cases`);<br>   - Canonical IBM SPSS Statistics syntax generator:</p><p><em>[code block — open in CapsuleCraft web for its canvas]</em></p><p>- Full `Undo` / `Redo` lifecycle support.</p><p>3. **DialogKit Desktop User Interface L6 (`statcraft_app::dialogs::regression_dialog`):**<br>   - Centered canonical modal dialog ($560 \times 430$ px, `Dia