aft_reporting`):**<br>   * Implemented modular leaf file `crates/statcraft_reporting/src/styling.rs` (363 lines, $\le 500$ lines pursuant to `file-guard`), 100% safe Rust;<br>   * Designed declarative typed model:<br>     - `TableStyleRule`: atomic formatting rule with table targeting (`table_target`), dimension addressing (`dimension`), target value selector (`value_target`), condition predicate (`condition`), and formatting style (`format`);<br>     - `TableTarget`: match all eligible tables (`AllEligible`) or specific subtype (`Subtype(String)`);<br>     - `DimensionTarget`: target columns (`Columns`), rows (`Rows`), or all cells (`Both`);<br>     - `TargetValue`: apply to all data cells (`AllDataCells`) or filter by header/row label (`Label(String)`);<br>     - `CellCondition`: value predicates (`All`, `Equal`, `NotEqual`, `LessThan`, `LessOrEqual`, `GreaterThan`, `GreaterOrEqual`, `Between`, `NotBetween`, `TopN(usize)`, `BottomN(usize)`, `SysMis`);<br>     - `CellStyleFormat`: typography (`bold`, `italic`), text color RGB (`text_color`), background color RGB (`bg_color`), and defaults reset directive (`reset_defaults`).<br>   * Computational engine `ConditionalFormattingEngine`:<br>     - Strict top-to-bottom rule evaluation priority (subsequent rules override overlapping cell coordinates);<br>     - Built-in ranking algorithms `TopN` and `BottomN` across columns, rows, and whole tables;<br>     - Tokenized label matching `label_matches`: eliminates substring false positives (e.g. searching `&quot;Male&quot;` never erroneously matches `&quot;Female&quot;`, while `&quot;Percent&quot;` correctly matches `&quot;Valid Percent&quot;`);<br>     - Safe floating-point parser `parse_num`: parses numeric cells with `%` stripping, comma thousands grouping, and European decimal comma handling without panicking.<br>2. **Table Model Integration &amp; Web Export L4 (`statcraft_reporting`):**<br>   * Extended `ReportTable` in `model.rs` with `pub cell_styles: HashMap&lt;(usize, usize), CellStyleFormat&gt;`;<br>   * In HTML report generator `html_export.rs`, implemented dynamic injection of inline CSS styles into `&lt;td&gt;` elements (`style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: rgb(...); background-color: rgb(...);&quot;`).<br>3. **Command Bus Schema Extension L5 (`statcraft_syntax`):**<br>   * Updated `stat.frequencies` command (`frequencies_cmd/mod.rs`) JSON schema `specs()` with `table_styles` (array of formatting rules) and `create_style_report` flag for AI agents.<br>4. **Quality Control &amp; Definition of Done:**<br>   * Developed integration test suite `crates/statcraft_reporting/tests/styling_tests.rs` (8 tests for predicates, ordering, TopN/BottomN, numeric parsing, and reset);<br>   * Added HTML export test `test_export_html_with_cell_styles` in `html_export.rs`;<br>   * 100% pass on all workspace tests with `-j 1` (`statcraft_reporting`, `statcraft_syntax`, `output_viewer_invariants`);<br>   * Full Quality Gate pass: `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- file-guard` (500 files within limits), `xtask layers` (L4/L5 adherence), `clippy -- -D warnings`, `cargo fmt --check`.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 110: Table Style &amp; Conditional Formatting — Phase 2: DialogKit UI &amp; Dialog Coordinator Decomposition (L6 statcraft_app)</h3><p>*Time: November 24, 2026, 16:55 (~40 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented a complete user interface suite for table style customization and conditional formatting (**Feature 019: Table Style / Conditional Formatting**) strictly adhering to IBM SPSS Statistics standards and the StatCraft DialogKit design system:<br>1. **Modular Subpackage `table_style_dialog` (`crates/statcraft_app/src/dialogs/table_style_dialog/`):**<br>   * All 4 modules strictly adhere to the $\le 500$ lines limit mandated by `file-guard`:<br>     - `state.rs` (230 lines): typed state `TableStyleState`, rule management operations (`add_rule`, `duplicate_rule`, `move_rule_up`, `move_rule_down`, `delete_rule`), transactional snapshot (`backup`) for guaranteed r