fonts(|f| f.layout_job(job))` produces an authentically slanted `Galley` of glyphs supporting true italics and underlines.<br>   * Bold styling is synthesized via subpixel overstrike (faux bold) directly across the slanted `Galley` at `+vec2(0.7, 0.0)` and `+vec2(0.35, 0.35)`.<br>   * Consequently, **bold, italic, and underline function harmoniously and concurrently** in both the preview sample `123` and in Pivot Table cells (`tables_common.rs`).<br>3. **Interactive Toolbar Toggles:**<br>   * Buttons `[ B ]`, `[ I ]`, `[ U ]` now render `.selected(...)` active styling and properly toggle off `fmt_use_defaults`.<br>4. **Quality Control &amp; Definition of Done:**<br>   * 50/50 `dialog_invariants` tests passing;<br>   * 100% clean Quality Gate execution via `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- ci` (10/10 gates, `file-guard`, `design-guard`, clippy with `-D warnings`, fmt);<br>   * Release binary `statcraft_app.exe` successfully rebuilt.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 115: Bootstrap Resampling Core, MT19937, and `BOOTSTRAP` Syntax (Feature 020 — Stage 1)</h3><p>*Time: November 24, 2026, 23:57 (~15 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented the UI-independent mathematical and syntactic core for bootstrap resampling across layers L1, L2, and L5 in strict accordance with Clean-room methodology (Efron &amp; Tibshirani, 1993; open `BOOTSTRAP` syntax specification) and the StatCraft Constitution:<br>1. **Deterministic PRNG `Mt19937` in L1 (`statcraft_core::rng`):**<br>   * Implemented the 32-bit Mersenne Twister (`Mt19937`) in 100% safe Rust with zero `unsafe`, `unwrap`, or `panic!`.<br>   * Added fixed `seed` initialization, `from_optional_seed()` falling back to `get_effective_random_seed()`, and unbiased `gen_range_usize` via rejection sampling.<br>   * Verified against the standard `MT19937` test vector (`seed = 5489`) for the first 10 outputs.<br>2. **Bootstrap Engine in L2 (`statcraft_algo::bootstrap`):**<br>   * `options.rs`: `BootstrapOptions` (`enabled`, `samples=1000`, `seed`, `ci_level=95.0`, `ci_method: Percentile | Bca`, `sampling_method: Simple | Stratified { strata_vars }`) with full parameter validation.<br>   * `resampler.rs`: `SamplingPlan` and `StratifiedPlan` supporting simple and stratified resampling with replacement (preserving exact stratum sizes $n_h$).<br>   * `ci.rs`: high-precision `normal_cdf` (Cody rational approximation), `compute_percentile_ci`, `compute_bca_ci` (bias-correction $z_0$, jackknife acceleration $\hat{a}$, and safe fallback on zero denominator), and `summarize_bootstrap` (`Bias`, `Std. Error`, `CI`).<br>   * `engine.rs`: generic `run_bootstrap` and `run_bootstrap_scalar` APIs.<br>3. **`BOOTSTRAP` and `SET MTINDEX` Syntax in L5 (`statcraft_syntax`):**<br>   * Added `bootstrap_param_schema()`, `bootstrap_to_sps()`, `parse_set_mtindex()`, and `parse_bootstrap_command()` in `crates/statcraft_syntax/src/bootstrap.rs`.<br>   * Added a one-shot `pending_bootstrap` modifier in `SyntaxDispatcher::execute_batch`, automatically injecting `params[&quot;bootstrap&quot;]` into the immediately following command and clearing it afterwards.<br>4. **Quality Control &amp; Definition of Done:**<br>   * All tests in `statcraft_core`, `statcraft_algo` (`bootstrap_tests.rs`), and `statcraft_syntax` (`bootstrap_syntax_tests.rs`) passing with `-j 1`;<br>   * `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -p statcraft_core -p statcraft_algo -p statcraft_syntax -j 1 -- -D warnings`, `xtask file-guard` (518 files), and `xtask layers` passing cleanly.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 116: Bootstrap Subdialog and End-to-End Frequencies Integration (Feature 021 — Stage 2)</h3><p>*Time: November 25, 2026, 00:26 (~30 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented the reusable **Bootstrap** modal subdialog (`BootstrapDialog`) and completed end-to-end bootstrap integration with the **Frequencies** procedure across layers L2, L5, and L6:<br>1. **Reusable UI Module (`crates/statcraft_app/src/dialogs/bootstrap_dialog/`):**<br>   * `state.rs`: `BootstrapDialogState` with `enabled`, `samples_input` (`&quot;1000&quot;`), `use_seed`, `seed_input` (`&quot;2000000&quot;`), `ci_level_input` (`&quot;95&quot;`), `ci_method` (`Percentile` / `Bca`), `sampling_method` (`Simple` / `Stratified`), `strata_vars`, `can_continue()` validation, and transactional `backup`/`restore`.<br>   * `mod.rs`: built strictly with `DialogKit` (`DialogShell`, `GroupBox` for Confidence Intervals and Sampling, `VariablePicker` + `TransferButton` for strata variables, `SubdialogActionBar`).<br>   * Full Fluent localization in `locales/en.ftl` and `locales/ru.ftl` (zero hardcoded strings).<br>2. **Frequencies Integration in L2 and L5:**<br>   * `statcraft_algo::frequencies::bootstrap`: implemented `FrequenciesBootstrapResult` and `compute_frequencies_bootstrap()` computing `Bias`, `Std. Error`, and `Percentile`/`BCa` intervals for active descriptive statistics and category percents.<br>   * `statcraft_syntax::commands::frequencies_cmd`: added `bootstrap` schema, stratified key extraction (`build_strata_keys` in `options.rs`), and `SET MTINDEX=...` + `BOOTSTRAP ... .` emission prior to `FREQUENCIES` in `sps.rs`.<br>3. **Output Viewer and UI Integration in L6:**<br>   * Enabled the `[ Bootstrap... ]` button in `frequencies_dialog` and wired `bootstrap` parameters into `Run` and `Paste` (`app_dialogs_stats.rs`).<br>   * Added `tables_frequencies/bootstrap_tables.rs` rendering `Bootstrap Specifications`, bootstrap statistics/frequency tables, and TSV export.<br>4. **Quality Control &amp; Definition of Done:**<br>   * `dialog_invariants` (51/51) and `output_viewer_frequencies_invariants` (9/9) passing;<br>   * Full Quality Gate `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- ci` (fmt, clippy, layers, file-guard, design-guard, i18n-lint, undo-redo matrix, sync-site, full workspace tests) passing 100%.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 117: Bootstrap Expansion to Core Procedures and Golden Oracle (Feature 022 — Stage 3)</h3><p>*Time: November 25, 2026, 00:42 (~15 minutes)*</p><p>Scaled the reusable bootstrap engine (Stage 1) and `Boo