utes)*</p><p>Implemented Stage 1 (zero-UI computational engine and syntax layer) for **TURF (Total Unduplicated Reach and Frequency) Analysis** per `specs/034-turf-core-and-syntax`:<br>1. **L2 Mathematical Engine (`crates/statcraft_algo/`):**<br>   * Added 4 leaf modules $\le 500$ lines (`turf_types.rs`, `turf.rs`, `turf_heats.rs`, `turf_tests.rs`) in 100% Safe Rust with zero `unwrap`/`expect`/`panic!`;<br>   * Implemented packed `Vec&lt;u64&gt;` respondent bitsets with fast bitwise `OR` subset unions and weighted popcount, respecting `WEIGHT BY` and `filter_$`;<br>   * Supported `CRITERIA`, `BESTN`, `NUMBERTODISPLAY`, `MINPERCENT`, `FORCE`, `REMOVALCYCLES`, `MAXSETS` (checked `u128` estimator), `/IMPORTANCE` weights (`STRICT`), and deterministic `Tournament Heats` (`/HEATS`) heuristic;<br>   * Verified with unit and Golden Oracle tests (`turf_tests.rs`).<br>2. **L5 Command Bus &amp; Syntax (`crates/statcraft_syntax/`):**<br>   * Implemented `TurfCommand` (`stat.turf`) in `commands/turf_cmd.rs`, registered in `CommandBus`, with canonical `SPSSINC TURF` emission in `to_sps()`;<br>   * Added two-word `SPSSINC TURF` (and `TURF` alias) parsing in `parser.rs` and `mappers/stats/turf.rs` covering `FORCE`, `/OPTIONS`, `/HEATS`, and `/IMPORTANCE`.<br>3. **Documentation &amp; Verification:**<br>   * Updated `specs/034-turf-core-and-syntax/spec.md`, `docs/SPSS_ALGORITHMS_AUDIT*.md`, `docs/SPSS_SYNTAX_PARSER_AUDIT*.md`, `docs/CHECKLIST.md`, and both chronicles.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 129: TURF Analysis Dialog &amp; UI Integration (Stage 2, `specs/035-turf-dialog-parity`)</h3><p>*Time: November 26, 2026, 09:45 (~20 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented Stage 2 (user interface, modal dialogs, and application wiring) for **TURF (Total Unduplicated Reach and Frequency) Analysis** per `specs/035-turf-dialog-parity`:<br>1. **L6 Dialogs (`crates/statcraft_app/src/dialogs/turf_dialog/`):**<br>   * Built 3 leaf modules $\le 500$ lines (`state.rs`, `subdialogs.rs`, `mod.rs`) strictly following `DialogKit` standards in 100% Safe Rust without panics;<br>   * Main dialog `TurfDialog`: `DialogSize::Compute`, dual-list variable picker via `VariablePicker` (`render_variable_list_panel`) and vector `TransferButton`, `GroupBox` (&quot;Limit size&quot;) with abort checkbox and `max_operations`, 6 parameter inputs (`max_combinations`, `num_to_display`, `min_positive_pct`, `positive_values`, `always_required`, `removal_cycles`), `Reach and Frequency chart` and `Show only results for maximum combination` checkboxes, `SubdialogSidebar`, and standard `DialogActionBar` (`OK`, `Paste`, `Reset`, `Cancel`, `Help`);<br>   * Subdialog `Importance Weights`: `DialogShell::subdialog`, `GroupBox` (&quot;Weight Checking&quot;) with `Strict` / `Default 1` radio buttons, multiline weight specification input with helper hint, and `SubdialogActionBar` with transactional rollback on Cancel;<br>   * Subdialog `Advanced Selection`: `DialogShell::subdialog`, large problems heuristic checkbox, parameter group with `Automatic` / `Specify` toggle and conditional size/winner inputs, and `SubdialogActionBar` with transactional rollback on Cancel.<br>2. **App Wiring &amp; Localization:**<br>   * Added menu item under **Analyze &gt; Descriptive Statistics &gt; TURF Analysis...** (`menu-analyze-turf`), disabled when no dataset is loaded;<br>   * Integrated runner in `app_dialogs_stats.rs` with `StatusMessage::TurfExecuted` and canonical `SPSSINC TURF` syntax logging into Output Viewer;<br>   * Added complete Fluent translation keys in `locales/en.ftl` and `locales/ru.ftl` with zero hardcoded strings.<br>3. **Verification &amp; DoD:**<br>   * Passed `dialog_invariants` test suite (53/53, including headless test `test_headless_render_turf_dialog_and_subdialogs`);<br>   * Linters `design-guard`, `file-guard`, and `clippy -- -D warnings` passed with zero errors or warnings;<br>   * Synchronized `docs/SPSS_UI_CANON_AUDIT*.md`, `docs/CHECKLIST.md`, and both chronicles.</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 130: TURF Analysis Output Tables, Vector Chart, Export &amp; Parity (Stage 3, `specs/036-turf-output-and-charts`)</h3><p>*Time: November 26, 2026, 10:20 (~25 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented Stage 3 (Output Viewer Pivot Tables, vector Reach &amp; Frequency chart via egui painter, TSV/HTML export, and parity tracking) for **TURF (Total Unduplicated Reach and Frequency) Analysis** per `specs/036-turf-output-and-charts`:<br>1. **Pivot Tables &amp; Visualizations L6 (`crates/statcraft_app/src/views/output_view/tables_turf/`):**<br>   * Created 3 isolated leaf modules $\le 500$ lines (`mod.rs`, `charts.rs`, `export.rs`) in 100% Safe Rust without panics;<br>   * `Case &amp; Parameter Summary` Table: summary of valid cases $N$, positive response criteria (`CRITERIA`), excluded variables filtered by `MINPERCENT`, operations estimate (`MAXSETS`), heuristic parameters (`HEATS`), always required variables (`FORCE`), and removal cycles (`REMOVALCYCLES`);<br>   * `Reach and Frequency Table(s)`: interactive pivot tables per removal cycle and combination size $k = 1 \dots K_{\max}$ with columns `Size`, `Variables`, `Reach`, `% of Cases`, `Frequency`, `% of Responses`, `Mean Responses`, and `Weighted Score` (when weights are configured);<br>   * `Reach and Frequency Chart`: 100% vector rendering using `ui.painter()` and `Tokens` design system (Accent Blue Reach % curve with circle markers, Coral Frequency % curve with square markers, 0..100% coordinate grid, ticks, legend, axes, zero emoji/tofu glyphs);<br>   * Report Export: TSV generator `turf_to_tsv` and report model `turf_to_report_tables` powering full document HTML and TXT export.<br>2. **Presentation &amp; Syntax Integration:**<br>   * Added `OutputItemKind::Turf(Box&lt;TurfOutputItem&gt;)` variant to `model.rs`;<br>   * Wired `add_turf` dispatch in `app_dialogs_stats.rs` upon dialog execution and in `syntax_runner.rs` for `SPSSINC TURF` / `TURF` batch execution;<br>   * Hooked up display rendering in `view.rs`, document export in `export.r